  "description": "A twisted journey to becoming meat-free. \n\nEver since the accident, Ma-Ha has been hearing voices that she shouldn't be hearing. If animals could speak, would you be able to eat the meat that comes from them? Ma-Ha, for one, can't stomach the thought so she searches for plant-based recipes that will keep her mind and body stay healthy. \n\n(Source: Manta, edited)",
